# Encapsulation

```text
Application
      │
      ▼
Data
      │
Transport
      ▼
Segment
(TCP / UDP)
      │
Network
      ▼
Packet
(IP)
      │
Data Link
      ▼
Frame
(MAC)
      │
Physical
      ▼
Bits
```

Receiving devices perform **De-encapsulation**, reversing the process back into usable data.

