# Subnetting

Subnetting divides a large network into smaller logical networks.

Benefits

* Better performance
* Better security
* Easier management
* Reduced broadcast traffic

Example

```
IP Address

192.168.1.25

Subnet Mask

255.255.255.0

Network

192.168.1.0

Host

25
```

