# DHCP

Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol automatically provides

* IP Address
* Subnet Mask
* Default Gateway
* DNS Server

DORA Process

```text
Client
   │
Discover
   ▼
Server
   │
Offer
   ▼
Client
   │
Request
   ▼
Server
   │
Acknowledge
```

