# ARP

Address Resolution Protocol converts

```
IP Address

↓

MAC Address
```

Example

```text
Need MAC for

192.168.1.10

↓

Broadcast

Who has 192.168.1.10?

↓

Reply

MAC
00:1A:2B:3C:4D:5E
```

Security Risk

ARP Spoofing

