# NAT

Network Address Translation

Allows many private devices to share one public IP.

```text
Laptop
192.168.1.2

Phone
192.168.1.3

TV
192.168.1.4

       │
       ▼

Router (NAT)

Public IP

154.xxx.xxx.xxx

       │
       ▼

Internet
```

Benefits

* Conserves IPv4 addresses
* Hides internal network

